    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">How AI Systems Work</title>
      <p>AI systems function by analyzing vast amounts of data and using algorithms to recognize patterns, make decisions, and improve their performance over time. This enables automation of complex tasks, optimizing efficiency across various industries.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Key Components of AI Systems</title>
      <p>AI systems rely on several key components to function: data sets, algorithms, computational power, and neural networks.</p>
