      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Barriers to Widespread Adoption</title>
      <p>Key barriers to AI adoption include the high costs of technology, the shortage of AI talent, and concerns about job displacement. Despite these barriers, AI is becoming increasingly integrated into industries like healthcare, finance, and manufacturing, driving innovation and progress.</p>
